{"items":[{"id":"1659579752741535744","title":"朋友昨天问我知道体制内什么是好工作吗? …","content":"<p>朋友昨天问我知道体制内什么是好工作吗?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我说不知道&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;他来了一句：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;不跟人民群众打交道的工作，就是好工作。</p>","excerpt":"朋友昨天问我知道体制内什么是好工作吗? …","voteupCount":119,"commentCount":6,"created":1688454646,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1659579752741535744"},{"id":"1658804397323956224","title":"现在写经济分析的主要矛盾是说假话昧良心…","content":"<p>现在写经济分析的主要矛盾是说假话昧良心与说真话就被删之间的矛盾。</p>","excerpt":"现在写经济分析的主要矛盾是说假话昧良心…","voteupCount":147,"commentCount":6,"created":1688269787,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1658804397323956224"},{"id":"1658494844912828416","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-004f80f0e9da30fb9f0478b41db133de_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"973\" height=\"362\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":135,"commentCount":10,"created":1688195984,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1658494844912828416"},{"id":"1658164003997110273","title":"我就说嘛，但凡有真金白银在市场上的，就…","content":"<p>我就说嘛，但凡有真金白银在市场上的，就没几个人不绝望的。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;但我没想到的是，老胡这倒的也太快了。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-09930cd98653ed3e60bcf60e9605e6fc_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"727\" height=\"791\">","excerpt":"我就说嘛，但凡有真金白银在市场上的，就…","voteupCount":132,"commentCount":10,"created":1688117105,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1658164003997110273"},{"id":"1657716861541187584","title":"这一看河南是真惨","content":"<p>这一看河南是真惨</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d63011b16726ac94118badb364d7044_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1913\">","excerpt":"这一看河南是真惨","voteupCount":83,"commentCount":36,"created":1688010507,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1657716861541187584"},{"id":"1656366112727232512","title":"这两天帮人填报志愿报的都快emo了","content":"<p>这两天帮人填报志愿报的都快emo了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;大家知道我说最多的话是啥吗？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;对女生，找个有钱的男朋友，将来生活就不错，对男生，找个有钱的老丈人，将来生活也能过得去。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我知道逻辑不闭环，但我没办法。</p>","excerpt":"这两天帮人填报志愿报的都快emo了","voteupCount":114,"commentCount":20,"created":1687688455,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1656366112727232512"},{"id":"1655173519087554561","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-2a48a6ea5b27d4046304da5bfdfb5c6e_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"550\" height=\"644\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":153,"commentCount":18,"created":1687404118,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1655173519087554561"},{"id":"1654126569076264960","title":"看看，我是不是大预言家？","content":"<p>看看，我是不是大预言家？</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-2eb5649fde026f97c9c6a4d8ba233862_ms.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9f2253f43b605eb2fd8d3833e3a93666_ms.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2400\">","excerpt":"看看，我是不是大预言家？","voteupCount":105,"commentCount":6,"created":1687154757,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1654126569076264960"},{"id":"1653351291597320192","title":"其实理性来看，养老这东西，向来还是看自…","content":"<p>其实理性来看，养老这东西，向来还是看自己的。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-4102801346342284a768ca6ec2f4a2f0_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"939\" height=\"842\">","excerpt":"其实理性来看，养老这东西，向来还是看自…","voteupCount":162,"commentCount":19,"created":1686969710,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1653351291597320192"},{"id":"1652359020831920128","title":"这就是尬黑","content":"<p>这就是尬黑。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;西方摆烂随时能实现，我们这摆烂是能随便实现的嘛。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-680829c46ebb8ec2b76e6f77fe425621_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"987\" height=\"466\">","excerpt":"这就是尬黑","voteupCount":179,"commentCount":11,"created":1686733123,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1652359020831920128"}]}